Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Although all nine reconstructed claims print `#Top`, the proof lacks a universal program-to-result claim, never executes the submitted `solution.mpy` in an entry claim, and remains successful after a material program-body mutation. The generated semantics also contains a demonstrably false generic slice rule.

